# CoffeeScript: CoffeeScript 2 documentation (coffeescript.org): language reference; requirements/languages/coffeescript.md
name     coffeescript coffee cson

keyword  if else unless then for in of by when while until loop switch case default try catch finally
keyword  throw return break continue class extends super new delete typeof instanceof and or not is isnt
keyword  do import export from await yield
builtin  true false null undefined yes no on off this

line-comment   #
block-comment  ### ###
string   """ """  : escapes multiline interp=hash
string   ''' '''  : escapes multiline
string   " "      : escapes interp=hash
string   ' '      : escapes
escape        : x=2 u4
sigil    @    : attr
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~
calls
regex
